      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for the feedback! We can investigate not reloading, but we're swapping out the entire base layer when you toggle this. I understand that for some avatars this reloading is inconvenient, but for others they might end up broken if not starting from a fresh baseline because we have no way to know how that avatar's base layer has interacted with the other layers. This might be a case where adjusting what parameters you save is the safest option, but I understand that the reload on toggle is undesirable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
