  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently your entire Avatar reloads when you are switching between Locomotion Animations being on or off. This can be a bit annoying sometimes, especially when you have paramters on your avatar which you have turned off the saving for. It’s also not so nice to see your Avatar reload when you do it.\nIf it’s possible I would hope that this could be changed, so that the Avatar doesn’t reload anymore when turning it on / off.",
